        "title": "A Piece of Hindu History ",
        "text": "Visited the Temple last week , its a must visit place for every hindu once in a lifetime. \nDarshan starts at 4:00 Am till 7:00Am in the morning and 5:00 Pm till 7:00 Pm in the evening during this period you can also attend the Arti.A big Nandi statue disrupts the view of the actual idol from the gates. The entry is only for Hindus I have heard but was not asked my religion at the entry.The temple complex is very large but except the main complex nothing is properly maintained which is more or less with every place in Kathmandu. \nWould've been very happy if the surroundings were clean & which can be done with little effort from the temple authorities. ",
